WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.369 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:05.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm black!
-And I'm gay!

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.475 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-And we're both women!

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:11.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'm not!
So here's how this works.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:13.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
I will read the setup
for these jokes,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Here we go.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York University
came under fire last month

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.555 size:84% position:42%
when their cafeteria
served watermelon water

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
to celebrate
Black History Month.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Said black people,
"I'm offended!

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
That there's not
more sugar in this."

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.698 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
-An out lesbian
recently competed

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
on Belgium's Olympic
skeleton team.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because if there's one thing
lesbians excel at,

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.575 line:92%
it's going down headfirst.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Jenny,
did you watch the Olympics?

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.114 line:92%
-I watched women's hockey!

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.450 size:84% position:42%
-Oh, great. Like, with
a big group of friends?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.253 line:92%
-No. Alone. With candles.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:56.389 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.857 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hockey?

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.459 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.127 line:92%
-A group of black parents

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
is suing a New Jersey
school district

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
for allegedly segregating
black students.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.933 line:92%
-Officials became suspicious

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:11.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
when one school
won every track meet.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Amber, did you do
a sport growing up?

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.642 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Yeah! I did gymnastics!

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
They even had
a fun nickname for me.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.379 line:92%
-Oh, yeah, what was that?

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"The black girl
who does gymnastics."

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.916 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay. Got it.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.417 line:92%
A Catholic school in Michigan

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.153 size:84% position:42%
recently fired their
lesbian softball coach.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.521 line:92%
-I got news for that school.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:32.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
You replaced her with
a lesbian softball coach.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.294 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:37.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Jenny,
do you like softball?

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, just parts of it.
-Oh, which parts?

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Third base.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:47.340
-"Clueless" star Stacey Dash is
reportedly running for Congress.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:52.412
-"Stacey who?" said black people
who know exactly who she is.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:55.148 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:59.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A female entrepreneur
has created a vacation resort

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:00.687 line:92%
where no men are allowed.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.823
-Women who visit can enjoy
activities like snorkeling

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
and finishing
their own sentences.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.996 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-All right. Nice one.

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:13.032
-And you know what I mean
by "snorkeling," Seth.

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.000 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Jenny!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean looking
at tropical fish.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.570 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And by "tropical fish,"
I mean --

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Jenny!

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.176 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:27.881
-A NASCAR pit crew has hired
its first black tire-changer.

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:31.684 size:78% position:39%
-Said NASCAR drivers,
"Hey! My hub caps!"

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.687 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Famously anti-gay pastor
Billy Graham

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.525 size:84% position:42% line:92%
passed away last month.

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:42.428
-And I like to think he's
looking up at us right now.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.997 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.866 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You got some oohs there.
-Yeah, a few oohs.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:52.872
I think his ghost was here,
and it is also homophobic.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.174 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh. Okay.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:56.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I don't think
it's a good idea, guys!

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:00.813 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Oh, come on. Just one!

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't feel like
this will end well.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please?!
-Please?!

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:07.520 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uhh...okay! Okay.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today is
International Women's Day.

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.890 line:92%
International Women's Day

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
is like a regular day,
but less rational.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.128 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Gasps]

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.462 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-How dare you!

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:17.730 line:92%
-You told me it would be okay!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You should be
ashamed of yourself!

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:21.067 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You promised me!

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:26.339 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:30.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll be right back with
Reese Witherspoon, everyone.

